{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o004b","title":"分江夏南部置都尉","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o004b-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"分江夏南部置都尉","evidence":["mingdi-e-o004b-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":227,"label":"春正月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y227","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o004","basis":"春正月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o004b-q","mingdi-q-o004","mingdi-q-o008","mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o004b-q","source_order":[3,31,"O004b"],"order":715}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o004b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3d867ec3331f738aeaf5","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年春正月，郊祀武皇帝，以配天；宗祀文皇帝于明堂，以配上帝〖1〗。分江夏南部，置江夏南部都尉。西平麹英反，杀临羌令、西都长〖2〗。遣将军郝昭、鹿磐，讨斩之。二月，辛未〖3〗，帝耕于籍田。辛巳〖4〗，立文昭皇后寝庙于邺。丁亥〖5〗，朝日于东郊。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o004","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3d867ec3331f738aeaf5","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年春正月，郊祀武皇帝，以配天；宗祀文皇帝于明堂，以配上帝〖1〗。分江夏南部，置江夏南部都尉。西平麹英反，杀临羌令、西都长〖2〗。遣将军郝昭、鹿磐，讨斩之。二月，辛未〖3〗，帝耕于籍田。辛巳〖4〗，立文昭皇后寝庙于邺。丁亥〖5〗，朝日于东郊。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
